11.1. Wind Tunnel Lab is an educational and experimental software project.

11.2. The Software is not represented as a validated professional CFD package, certified engineering tool, or replacement for physical wind-tunnel experiments.

11.3. Simulated aerodynamic forces, coefficients, velocity fields, pressure distributions, and other calculated values are approximate unless independently validated.

11.4. The Software must not be relied upon as the sole basis for:

- Aircraft or spacecraft design.
